<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Defs_L3_3_5_2" targetNamespace="https://teck.example/process-models/pillar-03">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collab_L3_3_5_2">
    <bpmn:participant id="Pool_L3_3_5_2" name="3.5.2 Tailings Classification" processRef="Process_L3_3_5_2"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_L3_3_5_2" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>L0/L1/L2 Process. Conditional — applies where the embankment is built with sand classified from the tailings (e.g., cyclone sand dams). Hydrocyclones split the tailings into a coarse, free-draining sand (underflow) for construction and a fine slurry (overflow) for deposition. Classification overflow is fine tailings slurry, not clarified water.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_L3_3_5_2">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_3_5_2_dcs" name="DCS / SCADA">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L3_3_5_2_s</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Service_L3_3_5_2_3_5_2_1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_5_2_3_5_2_2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Par_L3_3_5_2_f</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_3_5_2_e1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_3_5_2_tail" name="Tailings Operator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_5_2_3_5_2_3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gw_L3_3_5_2_g</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_3_5_2_e2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_5_2_n</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_3_5_2_e3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L3_3_5_2_s" name="Tailings at classification station">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_2_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Service_L3_3_5_2_3_5_2_1" name="3.5.2.1 Condition Classifier Feed">
      <bpmn:documentation>Tailings are diluted with water to the hydrocyclone feed density in a feed box or tank. Dilution water is a water use inside the facility, supplied from reclaim (3.6.2) or recovered seepage (3.6.3). [WATER: volume (dilution water added) | flow meter | continuous | MCA WAF | NO — internal recycle; WP-08]
ISA-95 level: 1 / 2
Actors: DCS / SCADA
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 1, 2
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: classification_telemetry)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_2_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_2_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_5_2_3_5_2_2" name="3.5.2.2 Classify Tailings by Hydrocyclone">
      <bpmn:documentation>Hydrocyclone batteries split the feed into a sand-rich underflow and a fines-rich overflow. Battery pressure and the number of cyclones in service are controlled to hit the sand specification. The split defines sand produced and fines sent to deposition. [P754: mass flow + density (sand and fines streams) | flowmeter + density gauge, or mass by difference | continuous | Principles 1, 7 | NO — TP-02 sand, TP-03 fines]
ISA-95 level: 0 / 2
Actors: DCS / SCADA; Tailings Operator
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0, 2; GISTM; AMIRA P754 Principles 1, 7
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: classification_telemetry)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_2_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_2_3</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:parallelGateway id="Par_L3_3_5_2_f">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_2_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_2_4</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_2_5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:parallelGateway>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_3_5_2_e1" name="Fines to deposition (3.5.3)">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_2_4</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_5_2_3_5_2_3" name="3.5.2.3 Verify Sand Quality for Construction">
      <bpmn:documentation>Sand for construction must meet a placement specification, typically fines content and % solids. Samples from the sand stream are tested at a defined frequency; off-specification sand is diverted to deposition instead of construction.
ISA-95 level: 3
Actors: Tailings Operator; Tailings Facility Engineer
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Level 3; GISTM
DDVC layer: Raw; Curated (construction_placement_record — quality attribute)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_2_5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_2_6</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_L3_3_5_2_g" name="Sand fit for construction?" default="Flow_L3_3_5_2_7">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_2_6</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_2_7</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_2_8</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_3_5_2_e2" name="Sand to construction (3.5.4)">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_2_7</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_5_2_n" name="Divert sand to deposition">
      <bpmn:documentation>Derived from the Process Flow Narratives section (not a row in the Process Decomposition). Off-specification sand response; no L4 row.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_2_8</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_2_9</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_3_5_2_e3" name="Rejected sand to deposition">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_2_9</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_2_1" sourceRef="Start_L3_3_5_2_s" targetRef="Service_L3_3_5_2_3_5_2_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_2_2" sourceRef="Service_L3_3_5_2_3_5_2_1" targetRef="Task_L3_3_5_2_3_5_2_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_2_3" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_5_2_3_5_2_2" targetRef="Par_L3_3_5_2_f"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_2_4" sourceRef="Par_L3_3_5_2_f" targetRef="End_L3_3_5_2_e1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_2_5" sourceRef="Par_L3_3_5_2_f" targetRef="Task_L3_3_5_2_3_5_2_3"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_2_6" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_5_2_3_5_2_3" targetRef="Gw_L3_3_5_2_g"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_2_7" name="Yes" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_5_2_g" targetRef="End_L3_3_5_2_e2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_2_8" name="No" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_5_2_g" targetRef="Task_L3_3_5_2_n"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_2_9" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_5_2_n" targetRef="End_L3_3_5_2_e3"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_L3_3_5_2">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_L3_3_5_2" bpmnElement="Collab_L3_3_5_2">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Pool_L3_3_5_2_di" bpmnElement="Pool_L3_3_5_2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="20" y="20" width="1406" height="510"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_3_5_2_dcs_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_3_5_2_dcs" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="20" width="1366" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_3_5_2_tail_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_3_5_2_tail" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="190" width="1366" height="340"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L3_3_5_2_s_di" bpmnElement="Start_L3_3_5_2_s"><dc:Bounds x="142" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="110" y="139" width="120" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Service_L3_3_5_2_3_5_2_1_di" bpmnElement="Service_L3_3_5_2_3_5_2_1"><dc:Bounds x="266" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_5_2_3_5_2_2_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_5_2_3_5_2_2"><dc:Bounds x="472" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Par_L3_3_5_2_f_di" bpmnElement="Par_L3_3_5_2_f"><dc:Bounds x="713" y="70" width="70" height="70"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_3_5_2_e1_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_3_5_2_e1"><dc:Bounds x="911" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="879" y="139" width="120" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_5_2_3_5_2_3_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_5_2_3_5_2_3"><dc:Bounds x="854" y="235" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gw_L3_3_5_2_g_di" bpmnElement="Gw_L3_3_5_2_g" isMarkerVisible="true"><dc:Bounds x="1110" y="240" width="70" height="70"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1039" y="204" width="100" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_3_5_2_e2_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_3_5_2_e2"><dc:Bounds x="1298" y="247" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1266" y="309" width="120" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_5_2_n_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_5_2_n"><dc:Bounds x="1060" y="405" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_3_5_2_e3_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_3_5_2_e3"><dc:Bounds x="1298" y="417" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1266" y="479" width="120" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_2_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_2_1"><di:waypoint x="198" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="266" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_2_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_2_2"><di:waypoint x="436" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="472" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_2_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_2_3"><di:waypoint x="642" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="713" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_2_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_2_4"><di:waypoint x="783" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="911" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_2_5_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_2_5"><di:waypoint x="748" y="140"/><di:waypoint x="748" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="854" y="275"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_2_6_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_2_6"><di:waypoint x="1024" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="1110" y="275"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_2_7_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_2_7"><di:waypoint x="1180" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="1298" y="275"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1184" y="255" width="27" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_2_8_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_2_8"><di:waypoint x="1145" y="310"/><di:waypoint x="1145" y="405"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1151" y="314" width="21" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_2_9_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_2_9"><di:waypoint x="1230" y="445"/><di:waypoint x="1298" y="445"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
